        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this bright and spacious two-bedroom apartment to the market, ideally positioned in the heart of the prestigious and highly sought-after Belfry development in Citywest, County Dublin.\nNo. 65 Belfry Hall is a beautifully presented, light-filled property that comes to the market in excellent condition throughout. Extending to c. 65 sq. m, the internal accommodation comprises of an inviting entrance hallway complete with additional storage space, a spacious open-plan kitchen/dining/living area, two generous double bedrooms, a master ensuite, and a main family bathroom. No. 65 is further enhanced by a sunny private balcony accessed directly from the lounge area, perfect for relaxing or entertaining.\nThe location of No. 65 is second to none. Citywest Village is within walking distance and offers an excellent selection of local amenities. Families are exceptionally well catered for with an impressive 29 primary schools and 9 secondary schools located within a 5km radius. Citywest Shopping Centre, just a 5-minute walk from your doorstep, hosts a wide range of retail and leisure facilities including a large Dunnes Stores and Energie Fitness gym. In addition, Citywest Business Campus is just moments away.\nTransport links are excellent, with the Red Line LUAS stop only a short stroll away, providing direct access to Dublin City Centre in under 30 minutes. The LUAS also connects conveniently to the Red Cow Airport Shuttle, offering easy access to Dublin Airport in approximately 20 minutes. The N7 and M50 motorways are easily accessible, while a number of bus routes including the 77X, 77A, and 65B operate nearby.\nEarly viewing is highly advised. To arrange a viewing, contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today.\n\nFeatures\n- 2 bed, 2 bath\n- Second floor apartment\n- B3 Energy Rating/ Green Mortgage Potential\n- Immaculately presented throughout\n- Double glazed windows\n- Electric heating\n- Sunny balcony leading from lounge\n- Management fee's c.2177 per annum\n- N7 & M50 motorway within an incredibly close proximity\n- Luas red line within walking distance\n- Citywest village within walking distance\n- Early viewing highly recommended\n\nBER details\nBER: B3\n\nDirections\nEircode: D24 Y863\n"
      },
